sequenceDiagram
  participant ClientApp
  participant PaymentAPI
  participant Gateway
  participant TransactionDB
  participant ReconciliationJob
  ClientApp->>PaymentAPI: POST /payments
  PaymentAPI->>PaymentAPI: Validate request
  PaymentAPI->>Gateway: Create payment
  Gateway-->>PaymentAPI: Gateway reference and status
  PaymentAPI->>TransactionDB: Save transaction
  PaymentAPI-->>ClientApp: 202 Accepted and payment ID
  Gateway-->>PaymentAPI: POST /webhooks/payment-status
  PaymentAPI->>TransactionDB: Update payment status
  ReconciliationJob->>TransactionDB: Read unmatched payments
  ReconciliationJob->>TransactionDB: Save reconciliation result
  ClientApp->>PaymentAPI: GET /payments/{id}
  PaymentAPI->>TransactionDB: Read transaction and status
  PaymentAPI-->>ClientApp: 200 OK with current status
